Package: fex-emu-wine
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: FEX DLLs enabling Wine's ARM64EC support
 FEX-Emu based emulator DLLs that allow aarch64 hosts running wine to
 execute x86 and x86_64 Windows code. Installed into wine's library
 directories (/usr/lib/wine/aarch64-windows and .../aarch64-unix) and
 loaded automatically by the wine ARM64EC loader.
 .
 This package builds the arm64ec and aarch64 PE DLLs plus the Wine
 unixlib shim (.so) counterparts.
